        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2024-07-29/pdf/2024-16740.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (Board). There is established, \neffective 12:01 a.m. eastern daylight time on July 25, 2024, a Board composed \nof a chair and two other members, all of whom shall be appointed by \nthe President to investigate and report on the dispute. No member shall \nbe pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of railroad employ-\nees or any carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the \navailability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2216,
      "char_start": 2100,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:14125#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:14125#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "89 FR 60791, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "57a7b1c8439e5104b615d5d9a01165cdacd31f6f2ba6966625c0d107ca11adfa",
